## Methodology

- Corpus: eval/data/world-v1/concepts__*.json (30 concept pages) + the full world-v1 index.
- Probes: programmatic, seeded (mulberry32 seed=42, Fisher-Yates sampling). Rerun produces the identical set across JS runtimes.
- Probe texts are globally unique: ambiguous candidates (same text claimable by >1 concept) are dropped at generation and the run aborts on any surviving duplicate.
- Graded gold: target concept=3, co-occurrence peers (share >=1 related company/person)=1. Company-neighborhood probes: every concept listing the company=3, the company page=1.
- Template mix: title paraphrase, title variation, description paraphrase, hand-authored synonyms, body-phrase fuzzy recall, semantic neighborhood (self-grounded), company neighborhood (global pass).
- Metric: nDCG@5 (primary, shared eval/runner/metrics.ts). P@5-graded = precision@5 against the grade>=1 set. P@1-strict = rank-1 is in the grade-3 target set.
- Top-K: 5.
- Embedder: voyage:voyage-4 @ 1024d for EVERY adapter (CAT13_EMBEDDING_MODEL / CAT13_EMBED_DIMS); the receipt records the gateway state after each adapter's init.
- Search pins on gbrain-backed adapters (gbrain, vector-grep-rrf-fusion): search.mode=balanced, search.reranker.enabled=true, search.autocut=false, search.reranker.model=voyage:rerank-2.5, search.metadata_boost_gate=lexical, search.expansion=false, search.cache.enabled=false, search.relational_rerank_pin=3, search.adaptive_return=false — set via engine.setConfig before ingest, echoed per adapter.
- Concept split: seeded Fisher-Yates over the sorted concept slugs (seed=42, separate rng from the probe generator); 20 tuning / 10 held-out. A probe is in a subset only when every grade-3 target is.
- Generic pins (--search-pin): search.metadata_boost_gate=lexical, search.expansion=false, search.cache.enabled=false, search.relational_rerank_pin=3, search.adaptive_return=false on the gbrain-backed adapters — pass-through engine.setConfig entries. gbrain ignores unknown search.* keys silently, so confirm each key exists in the linked gbrain (0.48.4.0) before reading this arm.
- No gold data passed to adapters; PublicPage/PublicQuery sealed at the boundary.

